                      label: 'Previous month',
                      onPressed: canBack ? () => _showMonth(-1) : null,
                    ),
                    Expanded(
                      child: Text(
                        names.monthYear(_month),
                        textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                        style: t.text.sm.copyWith(
                          fontWeight: FontWeight.w500,
                          color: c.foreground,
